   Files:   miniKanren/trs1/tests/ch1.rktl ... ch10.rktl

   Source:  The Reasoned Schemer, MIT Press, 2005, chapters 1-10.

   Copyright (C) 2005 Massachusetts Institute of Technology.
   All rights reserved by the copyright holder.

   These examples were transcribed from the book to check that the
   implementation produces the results printed in the book.  They are
